From 4659d7c1340eb3b75fe9a40a25bc33fc7bed81a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 13:20:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: reply-pinning + team group for the delegation loop
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Increment 2 on the delegation loop: fixes task misattribution when a member
has multiple open tasks, a cross-business supplier-lookup bug, and adds an
outbound-only team group so assignments/progress/standup are visible to the
whole team without risking free-text group messages minting customers.

- migration 030: promotes business_group_chat_id from the bootstrap-only
  schema.sql to a real migration.
- delegationLogic.mjs: pickTaskByReply (pure, unit tested) — matches a
  team member's reply to the exact task via assignee_message_id instead of
  always guessing the most-recently-assigned task.
- delegation.js: handleTeamMemberMessage / maybeAttachCompletionPhoto now
  pin by reply-to first, falling back to most-recent; pingAssignee and the
  completion photo-prompt keep assignee_message_id current so later replies
  keep pinning correctly; postToTeamGroup + handleTeamGroupMembership
  (auto-adopt on bot-added-to-group, DM confirmation with a disable button,
  clears on removal); assign/complete/escalate now post group visibility
  notes alongside the existing DMs.
- supplierReply.js: findSupplierByTelegram is now scoped by business_id —
  previously a supplier active for two businesses could get a reply silently
  dropped by the caller's business_id mismatch check.
- replyEngine.js: hard guard drops inbound group free-text before the
  customer flow (button taps still route via dispatchCallback, which reads
  the tapper's own id) so group participants are never minted as customers;
  dtask_groupoff callback (owner-only, task-independent) to turn the group
  off; dtask_done photo-prompt now re-points assignee_message_id.
- webhook route: wires handleTeamGroupMembership as a sibling to the
  existing channel-membership handler on my_chat_member.
- cron/team-standup: posts to the team group when configured, falling back
  to the owner DM.
- 6 new unit tests (22/22 delegation suite, 57/57 full suite); npm test and
  a full next build both pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015QxUDS2JMXm8PEueaMEhrV
